# ==============================================================================
# CtrlTest AI — Early Access Form Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# By default, submissions are automatically sent to hello@abdultalib.in via FormSubmit.co.
# If you prefer to receive submissions in Google Sheets or Web3Forms, uncomment and set the URL below:

# 1. Option 1: Google Apps Script Web App URL (Stores in Google Sheets + Instant Email)
# VITE_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=https://script.google.com/macros/s/YOUR_SCRIPT_ID/exec

# 2. Option 2: Web3Forms Endpoint
# VITE_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit

# 3. Option 3: FormSubmit.co (Default)
# VITE_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=https://formsubmit.co/ajax/hello@abdultalib.in
